# Services

The editable list of services the `service-health` job checks. Fill one row per service. Replace every `<...>` placeholder. The job reads this note and nothing else to know where to look.

Rules for filling it:
- Give the FULL identifier of each log source (full resource name or ARN, or full index and source). A short name can silently resolve to another environment.
- List production only. Keep non-production sources out of the table.
- Name noise you already know (health checks, startup banners) so the job does not report it.
- A service you leave out is never checked and never reported.

